5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the diggers will hit soft ground and delay everything. Who else is checking the site conditions?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The ground dictates the design, not the other way around. I’m checking how the current drainage and heat patterns actually behave before we commit to anything.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m trying to figure out who will actually look after the park every week. The staff numbers seem really low.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I’m looking at the condition of works from the earlier programme. I want to see what actually survived the last decade, not just the drawings.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I’m reviewing the upkeep ledger to see what these projects truly cost the city to maintain long-term, not just to build.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, do the drainage callouts show if the ground can handle heavy rain without flooding?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the callouts show the culvert is struggling, but I need to see the heat readings to understand the full picture of the site’s stress.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, do the old works still hold up, or do they need constant fixing?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the basin held, but the apron failed. I’m checking the planting records to see if the greenery survived the neglect.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, the ledger shows planted ground costs triple to maintain. I’m checking the groundskeeping roll to see if we have the staff to cover that gap.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if the ground is that stressed, will the earth-moving firms even quote fairly? I’m checking who is actually tendering for the dig work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, fair point. If only two firms are bidding, leverage drops. I’m checking the timed crossing counts to see how people actually use the space.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, if the old planting died because nobody watered it, will the new trees have the same problem?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, that is exactly the risk. I am checking the eastern avenue planting record to see if aftercare was simply ignored.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, the roll has shrunk to seven posts. I am checking the volunteer groups to see if they can fill the gap in daily care.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Minato, I’m checking the depot phasing notes to see if we can keep the park open while the diggers work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, if the apron failed, does that mean hard surfaces are a trap? I’m checking the habitat fund terms to see what we can actually afford to build.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, if the volunteers help, do they have the right tools and training for the daily work?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, I am checking the volunteer groups to see if their current commitments can realistically absorb the extra daily workload.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, I am checking the volunteer groups to see if their current commitments can realistically absorb the extra daily workload.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
