60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if the fund only covers planting and water, does that mean the wetland plan is the only one we can actually afford to build?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, precisely. The fund excludes surfacing and buildings, which eliminates the market and sports plans. We are left with the wetland or the woodland, both fitting the funding criteria.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, if the wetland needs constant water care, will the volunteers be able to handle it? I am worried about the daily workload.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
