64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, the ledger shows water-managed ground costs triple to maintain. With only seven staff, I fear the volunteers cannot absorb that daily burden.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
