66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the clay risk is real, but the fund terms force our hand. We must prioritize the water management to secure the capital, accepting the earth-moving constraints.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, if the wetland is the only affordable option, can the two firms handle the clay without massive delays?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
